Package: rrGDM
Type: Package
Title: Reduced-Rank Generalised Dissimilarity Modelling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Daniel", "Hernandez Carrasco",
      email = "dani.hc97@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Fits Reduced Rank Generalised Dissimilarity Models (RRGDM), which extend
    classic Generalised Dissimilarity Models by embedding sites in a low-dimensional
    latent space via 'TMB' (Template Model Builder). Environmental predictors, random
    effects, and effects on dispersion can all be specified directly on the latent
    positions rather than on pairwise distances, unifying community ordination and
    dissimilarity regression within a single likelihood-based framework. Includes
    tools for model fitting, prediction, inference on environmental loadings and
    dispersion effects, goodness-of-fit assessment, and visualisation of model-based ordination.
